      ],
      "decision": "Keep error logic in C. WINAPI thread bridge includes D session ownership; review creation/finish together in S13. Sole CloseHandle operand is hThread from CreateThread: graphics redirection is unnecessary at this caller. Narrow Console binding scope in S13 instead of claiming a thread handle needs graphics state. No caller edit or extra selector introduced."
    },
    {
      "linkOnlyOrder": 28,
      "path": "src/mvdm-host/softpc.new/host/src/nt_fdisk.c",
      "ids": [
        "C0308",
